{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q75175937","formula":"C₃₀H₃₀F₂N₆O₃","hill":"C30H30F2N6O3","elements":["H","C","N","O","F"],"composition":{"C":30.0,"F":2.0,"H":30.0,"N":6.0,"O":3.0},"names":{"en":"Sotorasib","ru":"Соторасиб"},"descriptions":{"en":"Sotorasib, sold under the brand names Lumakras and Lumykras, is an anti-cancer medication used to treat non-small-cell lung cancer. It targets a specific mutation, G12C, in the protein K-Ras encoded by gene KRAS which is responsible for various forms of cancer. Sotorasib is an inhibitor of the RAS GTPase family.","ru":"Соторасиб, продаваемый под торговыми названиями Lumakras и Lumykras, — это лекарственный препарат, используемый для лечения немелкоклеточного рака легких (НМРЛ). В частности, его используют при прогрессирующем заболевании с мутацией KRAS G12C, когда другие методы лечения оказались неэффективными. Соторасиб принимают внутрь перорально."},"fame":10,"pubchemCid":137278711,"mass":560.6,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@H]1CN(CCN1C2=NC(=O)N(C3=NC(=C(C=C32)F)C4=C(C=CC=C4F)O)C5=C(C=CN=C5C(C)C)C)C(=O)C=C","inchikey":"NXQKSXLFSAEQCZ-SFHVURJKSA-N","iupac":"6-fluoro-7-(2-fluoro-6-hydroxyphenyl)-1-(4-methyl-2-propan-2-yl-3-pyridinyl)-4-[(2S)-2-methyl-4-prop-2-enoylpiperazin-1-yl]pyrido[2,3-d]pyrimidin-2-one","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"137278711","atoms":71,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":4.054,"y":-0.444,"z":-2.905,"el":"C"},{"x":3.392,"y":-1.027,"z":-1.653,"el":"C"},{"x":4.409,"y":-1.756,"z":-0.731,"el":"C"},{"x":5.258,"y":-0.804,"z":-0.001,"el":"N"},{"x":4.478,"y":0.165,"z":0.769,"el":"C"},{"x":3.546,"y":0.964,"z":-0.157,"el":"C"},{"x":2.646,"y":0.055,"z":-0.93,"el":"N"},{"x":1.442,"y":-0.302,"z":-0.32,"el":"C"},{"x":1.316,"y":-1.47,"z":0.229,"el":"N"},{"x":0.162,"y":-1.861,"z":0.864,"e